This tool simplifies and streamlines the end-to-end migration process between Zimbra Collaboration servers, regardless of version (ZCS 7.x through 10.1.x) or edition (Open Source, Network Edition, or Carbonio CE/FOSS). Motivated by real-world migration challenges and enterprise requirements, Z2Z provides automated LDAP provisioning, high-speed alias extraction, zero-timeout mailbox archiving, and multi-distro compatibility.
